## 7. PERFORMANCE, SEO, AND PRODUCTION POLISH

**Performance targets (mobile, throttled):** Lighthouse Performance >= 95, LCP < 2.0s, CLS < 0.05, INP < 200ms, total JS as small as possible, no render-blocking requests beyond critical CSS[cite: 1]
- Inline critical CSS or keep CSS small; code-split routes; defer non-critical JS; avoid heavy libraries (no jQuery, no giant animation libs)[cite: 1]
- Preload key font; lazy-load below-the-fold illustrations[cite: 1]
- Compress and properly size all assets; SVG optimized[cite: 1]
- Avoid layout shift: reserve space for diagrams, embeds, fonts[cite: 1]

**SEO and sharing**
- Unique `<title>` (<= 60 chars) and meta description (<= 155 chars) per view, canonical URL, `lang="en-IN"`[cite: 1]
- Open Graph + Twitter Card tags with a designed 1200x630 share image[cite: 1]
- Favicon set (SVG + 32px + apple-touch-icon 180px), `manifest.webmanifest`, `theme-color` for light/dark[cite: 1]
- JSON-LD structured data (`GovernmentService` / `CivicStructure` for Mira-Bhayandar Civic Issue Tracking)[cite: 1]
- `robots.txt`, `sitemap.xml`, clean semantic URLs[cite: 1]

**Security and privacy basics**
- `rel="noopener noreferrer"` on external `target="_blank"` links[cite: 1]
- No secrets in client code; sanitize any user input rendered back[cite: 1]

