## 8. CODE QUALITY AND PROJECT STRUCTURE

- Clean, readable, commented only where intent isn't obvious. No dead code, no unused CSS, no `console.log` left behind, no TODOs shipped[cite: 1]
- Consistent naming (BEM or component-scoped CSS), small reusable components, a clear folder structure[cite: 1]: